flowchart TD
    Start[Setup] --> Caller{Library or CLI?}
    Caller -->|Library| Identity{Target matches on the migration session?}
    Identity -->|Yes| Schema[Apply migrations and validate placement]
    Identity -->|No| Fail[Fail with context and retain completed work]
    Caller -->|CLI| Schema
    Schema --> Install{Install evaluators?}
    Install -->|No| Done[Success]
    Install -->|Yes| Select[Verify library tag and catalog digest or select CLI collection]
    Select --> Valid{Catalog valid and supported?}
    Valid -->|No| Fail
    Valid -->|Yes| Load[Read installed evaluator metadata in one batch]
    Load --> Next{More evaluators?}
    Next -->|No| Done
    Next -->|Yes| Existing{Installed version?}
    Existing -->|Matching| Next
    Existing -->|Conflicting| Fail
    Existing -->|Absent| Download[Bounded download and checksum verification]
    Download --> Verify{Package and host ABI match catalog?}
    Verify -->|No| Fail
    Verify -->|Yes| Publish[Insert missing version; retain newer and older versions]
    Publish --> Next
    Download -. Request or integrity failure .-> Fail
    Publish -. Database failure .-> Fail
    Schema -. Database failure .-> Fail
